Cell["\<\
So there\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a constant offset of mean(dt) \[Omega]/2 (can be \
calibrated out), with noise sigma(dt) * omega/2.\[LineSeparator]In addition, \
there\[CloseCurlyQuote]s some HF at 2\[Omega], which has to be filtered out.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9629514863262653`*^9, 3.962951530972472*^9}, {
  3.962951586965022*^9, 3.9629516570391397`*^9}, {3.962951783181875*^9, 
